### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Get Initial Metrics (Expect 0)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/metrics

### List Available Reports (Lazy query - total_instantiations remains 0)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports

### Generate Report 3 (First time - instantiates heavy object, count becomes 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/report-3/generate?role=guest

### Verify Metrics Counter (Expect 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/metrics

### Protection Proxy Denied - Unauthorized Role (Expect 403 Forbidden, count stays 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/report-1/generate?role=guest

### Protection Proxy Granted - Authorized Admin (Expect 200 OK, count becomes 2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/report-1/generate?role=admin

### Verify Metrics Counter (Expect 2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/metrics

### Reset Metrics Counter
POST http://localhost:8080/api/metrics/reset

### Non-existent Report (Expect 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/non-existent/generate?role=admin
